## The Open Source Handoff

I didn't just build this for myself. I've open-sourced the entire 50-line dashboard on GitHub. 

Clone it, tweak the visuals, plug in your own watchlist, or wire it up to a Telegram bot for daily alerts. The UI is entirely yours to customize. 

The only thing you need is a free Sentimatix API key to fetch the live data.

